  triage:title "open_advisory_stream recv_timeout: None — indefinite block" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-graft/src/lib.rs open_advisory_stream uses recv_timeout: None, creating indefinite block on stream open. Should use bounded timeout to avoid deadlock on daemon unavailability." ;
